{"id":"11b60d6a0ba187b5","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-external-redex.md","title":"正交系统的外部红项","display":"df-external-redex — 正交系统的外部红项","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-external-redex","aliases":["56-df-external-redex"],"display":"df-external-redex — 正交系统的外部红项","depends_on":["[[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]","[[56-df-outermost-redex-position]]"],"source_section":"§9.2 Definition 9.2.31; Examples 9.2.32(ii–iii), orthogonal specialization","source_printed_pages":"497","source_ocr_blocks":[518],"source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; orthogonal occurrence-coding-local","source_proof_status":"definition-well-formedness-checked; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-external-redex"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-external-redex</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-external-redex — 正交系统的外部红项"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fec2299959a8e3bb\" href=\"?note=fec2299959a8e3bb\" title=\"56-df-reduction-residual-transport\">56-df-reduction-residual-transport</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"246c089e11e34935\" href=\"?note=246c089e11e34935\" title=\"56-df-outermost-redex-position\">56-df-outermost-redex-position</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.2 Definition 9.2.31; Examples 9.2.32(ii–iii), orthogonal specialization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"497"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>518</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; orthogonal occurrence-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-well-formedness-checked; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fec2299959a8e3bb\" href=\"?note=fec2299959a8e3bb\" title=\"56-df-reduction-residual-transport\">56-df-reduction-residual-transport</a> 的正交系统，采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}_R,\\operatorname{Red}_R,\\mathcal F_R,\\ell,\\operatorname{src},\\operatorname{tgt},\\rho|_i\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_R,\\operatorname{Red}_R,\\mathcal F_R,\\ell,\\operatorname{src},\\operatorname{tgt},\\rho|_i\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,s)\">\\(\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,s)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"246c089e11e34935\" href=\"?note=246c089e11e34935\" title=\"56-df-outermost-redex-position\">56-df-outermost-redex-position</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExternalRed}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{ExternalRed}_R\\)</span> 独立定义于所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>。两个外部性谓词的局部红项参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\">\\(u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtTo}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtTo}_R\\)</span> 另取局部路径参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s\">\\(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{External}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{External}_R\\)</span> 的路径由内部量词绑定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtTo}_R(\\rho,u)\\iff\n\\forall i\\le\\ell(\\rho)\\;\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho|_i,u)\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{pos}(v)\\in\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho|_i))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ExtTo}_R(\\rho,u)\\iff\n\\forall i\\le\\ell(\\rho)\\;\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho|_i,u)\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{pos}(v)\\in\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho|_i))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{External}_R(s,u)\\iff\n\\forall\\rho\\in\\{\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R:\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=s\\}\\;\\operatorname{ExtTo}_R(\\rho,u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{External}_R(s,u)\\iff\n\\forall\\rho\\in\\{\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R:\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=s\\}\\;\\operatorname{ExtTo}_R(\\rho,u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExternalRed}_R(s)\\coloneqq\n\\{u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\mid\\operatorname{External}_R(s,u)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ExternalRed}_R(s)\\coloneqq\n\\{u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\mid\\operatorname{External}_R(s,u)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一般左线性系统的原书定义为残余从不被其他红项嵌套；模式重叠并不等于嵌套。因此一般系统中“external”不能无条件改写为“总是outermost”。这里明确限定正交：任意两红项无模式重叠，严格在上方的红项必通过左项变量实例嵌套下方红项，两条件才一致。路径包含源项，公式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=0\">\\(i=0\\)</span> 保证外部红项首先是最外红项；全称有限路径足以表达沿任何无限路径每个有限时刻的持久性。</p>\n<p>被收缩红项随后残余为空，后续全称条件真空满足。定义没有把“某条路径中的外部红项”误用为“对所有路径都外部”；原书Examples 9.2.32(ii)表明前者依赖路径。不存在可计算见证的结论，也不把needed与external等同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-reduction-residual-transport","status":"resolved","id":"fec2299959a8e3bb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-outermost-redex-position","status":"resolved","id":"246c089e11e34935","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-outermost-redex-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-residual-transport","status":"resolved","id":"fec2299959a8e3bb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]] 的正交系统，采用 $\\operatorname{Res}_R,\\operatorname{Red}_R,\\mathcal F_R,\\ell,\\operatorname{src},\\operatorname{tgt},\\rho|_i$。$\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,s)$ 见 [[56-df-outermost-redex-position]]。$\\operatorname{ExternalRed}_R$ 独立定义于所有 $s\\in T$。两个外部性谓词的局部红项参数为 $s\\in T$、$u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$；$\\operatorname{ExtTo}_R$ 另取局部路径参数 $\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$、$\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s$，$\\operatorname{External}_R$ 的路径由内部量词绑定。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-outermost-redex-position","status":"resolved","id":"246c089e11e34935","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]] 的正交系统，采用 $\\operatorname{Res}_R,\\operatorname{Red}_R,\\mathcal F_R,\\ell,\\operatorname{src},\\operatorname{tgt},\\rho|_i$。$\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,s)$ 见 [[56-df-outermost-redex-position]]。$\\operatorname{ExternalRed}_R$ 独立定义于所有 $s\\in T$。两个外部性谓词的局部红项参数为 $s\\in T$、$u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$；$\\operatorname{ExtTo}_R$ 另取局部路径参数 $\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$、$\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s$，$\\operatorname{External}_R$ 的路径由内部量词绑定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Res}_R,\\operatorname{Red}_R,\\mathcal F_R,\\ell,\\operatorname{src},\\operatorname{tgt},\\rho|_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExternalRed}_R","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExtTo}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{External}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExtTo}_R(\\rho,u)\\iff\n\\forall i\\le\\ell(\\rho)\\;\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho|_i,u)\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{pos}(v)\\in\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho|_i))\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{External}_R(s,u)\\iff\n\\forall\\rho\\in\\{\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R:\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=s\\}\\;\\operatorname{ExtTo}_R(\\rho,u).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExternalRed}_R(s)\\coloneqq\n\\{u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\mid\\operatorname{External}_R(s,u)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"i=0","display":false}],"bytes":2572,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-199","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-external-redex.md]]"},{"id":"3929f56790d04f90","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-external-redex]] 的正交系统与 $\\operatorname{External}_R$、$\\operatorname{ExtTo}_R$，$s\\in T$、$u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$，且 $\\operatorname{External}_R(s,u)$。$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$ 满足 $\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s$；$a=(s,v,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R$。$\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R$、$\\operatorname{Res}_R$ 与拼接律见 [[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]] 及其上游。"}],"outgoing":["fec2299959a8e3bb","246c089e11e34935"]}